    {
      "id": "claim_0c8681a285844438a0f51dfa58e5bff4",
      "statement": "arbitrary_types_allowed=True is what allows the framework's own models to be DTOs while carrying runtime objects: PackedFeatureOrAppService holds run: RunFn (a bound callable, stated in its docstring as the reason the flag is needed) and FeatureOrAppServiceMetadata holds instance: Feature | ApplicationService, so the catalog/metadata models could not be built without it.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/catalog.py#L20-L35",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e19f9444570efdd19bc648877ca4e93369bd8782586055b61b55d2711216db16:"
