          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ec416cb71628a70e23684c6a3389249fc7f2e5b0c57f0eed2e7ade336dad11d1:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c4d2a934554142fcb51ea575b624dfa3",
      "statement": "validate_fn is a construction-time middleware: it runs in the generated class's __new__, a non-None return replaces the input value, a None return keeps the input (validator-only), and raising ValueError there rejects the object before it ever exists.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/ddd/value_object.py#L14-L19",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:530be573a7f6a89cb9ffe761b6ae1a110a464c95ca829f7d70ea1696d218125c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/ddd/value_object.py#L55-L72",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9a5a5cb77a094fcfa4b753d1395c610912e8cceda0bb64949ca9d9ef43aa308f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8b517982de064f03b556162252f3e731",
      "statement": "The generated value-object class implements the pydantic v2 hooks itself: __get_pydantic_core_schema__ returns a chain_schema of the base primitive's schema followed by a no_info_plain_validator_function(cls), and __get_pydantic_json_schema__ rewrites only the title to the value-object name, leaving the JSON type primitive.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/ddd/value_object.py#L24-L41",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:30cccd095ff38e710b13588f4ecb0db960c72854ef6a9308f6394140dd8aaabb:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5618ccb9024a4124bc7f8d6d7ca0cfc5",
      "statement": "Because the chain validator is the class constructor, validate_fn runs once when a raw scalar is placed on a DTO field and runs twice when an already-built value-object instance is assigned to that field (once at explicit construction, again when pydantic re-validates by calling the class), so validate_fn must be idempotent.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/ddd/value_object.py#L24-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ea3dbd13272ca240fd81607d9731dbdd5cf4f8bbb44093b690279b937b732249:"
