    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ed1056867a3448aeadda27a58dffbb21",
      "statement": "Only the publishing paths pass filter_binaries_schema=True — the JSON-RPC method index and the MCP server() — whereas the in-process Entrypoint.tools() and to_callables() include binary DTOs because they never serialize, so an excluded DTO stays callable via framework(dto) and is only absent from the JSON surface.",
