    {
      "id": "claim_30dd34f3ffe24aaa97613aa15c4a9340",
      "statement": "dto_json_schema catches any exception from model_json_schema() and falls back to a generic {\"type\": \"object\", \"title\": <class name>} schema, so a DTO whose types pydantic cannot express still gets published as an input with a schema that reveals none of its fields.",
