    {
      "id": "claim_8ee94f73050a48e392abf5c661f1e14b",
      "statement": "The response half mirrors the input filter: dump_scalar_result dumps a pydantic response with model_dump(mode=\"json\"), passes a dict through, wraps any other value as {\"result\": value}, and when json.dumps still rejects the payload it stringifies the offending leaves and logs a warning instead of raising after the side effect already ran.",
