    {
      "id": "claim_ff0644438db44a4f9fd61127d3b990ee",
      "statement": "new_value_object(new_type, validate_fn) is deprecated and will be removed in the next major release: it emits a DeprecationWarning on every call and its docstring names ValueObject(int, fn, name=...) as the replacement; it accepts either a NewType instance (reading __supertype__/__name__/__module__) or a plain type and delegates to the same internal builder.",
