    {
      "id": "claim_ce07379226264069a82f93d3f20ce988",
      "statement": "The hand-written architecture document still presents only the deprecated new_value_object path as the DDD value-object pattern, so its examples no longer match the implemented surface, which is ValueObject(...).",
