    {
      "id": "claim_92a9d878dbba4ab5a61e276c42b6682a",
      "statement": "On a JSON wire a value object stays a primitive with the value-object name as title (e.g. title \"UserId\", type \"integer\"), which is what OpenRPC content descriptors read from schema properties and what fastmcp_callable reproduces from the DTO's model_fields — carrying Annotated Field metadata for a default_factory so a per-call default is never frozen into the published signature at import time.",
